      "params": [
        {
          "name": "In Object",
          "type": "UObject*",
          "default": "nullptr"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Objects we searched for in the Package being saved; we need to execute various operations on\nall of these objects, most notably BeginCacheForCookedPlatformData family of functions.\nWe keep track of a WeakPtr to the object along with its flags in case it gets deleted and we\nneed to decide how to respond to the deletion it based on what its flags were."
